in:2734", "sentence": "No C2 protein translation is detected in type I deficiency , while type II deficiency is characterized by a selective block in C2 secretion .", "entities": []}, {"id": "train:4064", "sentence": "Heterozygous C2 - deficiency and myasthenia gravis .", "entities": [{"text": "C2 - deficiency", "type": "DISEASE", "occurrence": 0}, {"text": "myasthenia gravis", "type": "DISEASE", "occurrence": 0}]}], "cache_hit": false, "input_entities": [], "output_entities": [{"text": "Type II human complement C2 deficiency", "type": "DISEASE", "start": 0, "end": 38, "start_token": 0, "end_token": 6, "occurrence": 0, "sources": ["molecular"]}]}
